    "campaign": {
      "revision": "campaign-r2-hybrid-full-v1-parent-review-pending",
      "instructions": "Print only supplied Simplified Chinese artwork text. Professional operational Chinese: clear reconciliation objects and responsible team, concise question and practical next step. Use supplied mainland terminology, not word-for-word Vietnamese syntax. No assumptions about national personality, certification or guaranteed results. Keep original scene and narrative order. Preserve Simplified Chinese glyphs and exact supplied punctuation. Never mix scripts or use pseudo-Chinese. Use ASCII parentheses for approved acronym definitions to remain compatible with the frozen gate; do not normalize other punctuation. Review Chinese punctuation at line starts/ends and mixed Latin terms at 333px; reduce scene area before shrinking type. B13v5 bright white/blue photographic campaign family. Reference wording is not approved copy. Official supplied logo once; no extra DIGIWIN header. Exact category/sequence near logo. Body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Source normal full-width main paragraph on white, at least body-sized. All paper blank; no bars/rules/charts/ticks/data glyphs/UI/customer geography/seal/badge. Only approved artwork words. Demand-change questions are not forecast accuracy or automatic replanning claims. Reduce scene before type."
    },
